OL,3,GNEWSATT sidecar racing to return with
OL,4,Anew rules
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter a review of the class, organisers
OL,7,Fsaid changes would give competitors and
OL,8,Fconstructors "greater certainty",
OL,9,Fbringing in "a new generation of TT
OL,10,FSidecar regulations".
